      "applicable_notes": [
        {
          "label": "Accounting Policies",
          "meaning": "US GAAP and consolidated Microsoft plus subsidiaries, with intercompany eliminations. Revenue is recognized on transfer of control. Disclosed prior-period recasts had no effect on the consolidated income statements. Foreign currency revenue is translated at average rates.",
